{"meta":{"ui":"data_table","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show the twelve invoices you found as a table with number, customer, date, amount and status: #1001 Acme Corp May 02 $1,200 Paid; #1002 Globex May 05 $860 Due; #1003 Initech May 09 $430 Overdue; #1004 Umbrella May 12 $2,250 Paid; #1005 Hooli May 15 $975 Due; #1006 Stark Ltd May 16 $3,100 Overdue; #1007 Wayne Co May 18 $640 Paid; #1008 Wonka May 20 $1,480 Due; #1009 Soylent May 22 $300 Overdue; #1010 Cyberdyne May 24 $5,200 Paid; #1011 Tyrell May 27 $760 Due; #1012 Aperture May 29 $1,890 Paid. I can sort by any column (date first), filter by status (All, Paid, Due, Overdue), type to search the customer, page through five at a time, and tick rows (and tick all on the page). When anything is ticked a bar shows \"N selected\" with the total of the ticked amounts and a button to send reminders.","text":"ChatCard \"Invoices\" \"12 invoices, May\" icon:\"receipt_long\" status:\"Live\"\n  Input \"Search customer\" \"Type a name\" =q\n  Segments =status options:[\"All\",\"Paid\",\"Due\",\"Overdue\"]\n  state sort=\"date\"\n  state desc=false\n  state page=0\n  state picked=[]\n  let rowsAll = [{\"id\":\"1001\",\"customer\":\"Acme Corp\",\"date\":\"May 02\",\"day\":2,\"amount\":1200,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"1002\",\"customer\":\"Globex\",\"date\":\"May 05\",\"day\":5,\"amount\":860,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"1003\",\"customer\":\"Initech\",\"date\":\"May 09\",\"day\":9,\"amount\":430,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"1004\",\"customer\":\"Umbrella\",\"date\":\"May 12\",\"day\":12,\"amount\":2250,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id\":\"1005\",\"customer\":\"Hooli\",\"date\":\"May 15\",\"day\":15,\"amount\":975,\"status\":\"Due\"},{\"id\":\"1006\",\"customer\":\"Stark Ltd\",\"date\":\"May 16\",\"day\":16,\"amount\":3100,\"status\":\"Overdue\"},{\"id\":\"1007\",\"customer\":\"Wayne Co\",\"date\":\"May 18\",\"day\":18,\"amount\":640,\"status\":\"Paid\"},{\"id